{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713710/extras/LibraryLogo.png?t=1747817569\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Torenstad</strong> is a small tower-builder game where the main goal is to get as high as possible on the leaderboards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You control falling blocks and try to find the best spot to place them. The scoring system is based on how many full floors you can complete in your tower \u2014 the better your placements, the higher your score.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Falling blocks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Steam Leaderboards and Stats</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Infinite build height</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A chance to beat your friends</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dynamic scoring based on floors</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Future plans:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">New block visuals and scoring calculations</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Daily challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Events as the tower goes higher</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">General polishing</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Thank you for the support! Much\u00a0\u2764\ufe0f!</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713710?t=1747817569","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713710?t=1747817569","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713710/5a15bffb5f4f0ac78ee041e951c0ce609f539f66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747817569","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713710/5a15bffb5f4f0ac78ee041e951c0ce609f539f66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17